---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok Videos"
  description="Explore Khao Sok Videos for a glimpse into hiking and lake adventures. Get inspired for your Khao Sok journey today."
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok Videos"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Videos", "href": "/khao-sok-videos/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Enjoy this insight into the area with our Khao Sok Videos. whether you are planning to hike through the Khao Sok national park or experience the Cheow Larn lake we have some great videos here. Know before you go. Get a taste of the adventures that lie ahead on your Khao Sok trip. Of course you need somewhere to stay and Riverside Cottages not only offer excellent accommodation but we also help you make the most of your stay. Check out our <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">great value packages</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Get to know the wildlife with our 'Khao Sok Sounds' videos. Discover the top activities to include during your visit.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We hope that our Khao Sok videos helped to make your mind up to come visit us.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>YouTube Playlists</span>
        </h2>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>The Resort</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          9 videos
        </p>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Packages</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          4 videos
        </p>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Activities</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          14 videos
        </p>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Discover more videos on our social channels.
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
